        "context_manifest": "/home/puppeteer/MathOCRClaw/benchmark/runs/20260827-163923/workflow/page20/code_outputs/match/question_contexts.json"
      },
      "handwritten_answer": {
        "text": "$\\sin A\\cos C + \\sin C\\cos A = 2\\sin B\\cos B$\n$\\sin(A+C) = 2\\sin B\\cos B$\n$\\sin B = 2\\sin B\\cos B$\n$1 = 2\\cos B$\n$\\cos B = \\frac{1}{2}$\n$b=12$\n$\\cos B = \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{a^2+c^2-b^2}{2ac} = \\frac{a^2+c^2-144}{2ac} = \\frac{1}{2}$\n$ac = a^2+c^2-144$\n$S = \\frac{1}{2}ac\\sin B = \\frac{1}{2}(a^2+c^2-144)\\times\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$",
